omx-panel (0.13.8) unstable; urgency=medium

  * tools/rta-console-reference.mjs is not executable
  * Remove omx-panel's back-compat machinery
  * test: no back-compat mechanism is left in omx-panel (red)
  * release-version test: a dry-run snapshot suffix is accepted on the same
    base only
  * ci: the shared checks at openmixer-v1, not the missing v1
  * ci: the release proof checks out the shared checks at openmixer-v1
  * Every omx-contract floor says 3.18.0: the offline build check named 3.12.0
  * test: every declared omx-contract floor is the same version (red)
  * group-infer: the omx-eq8 fixture is omx-plugins 0.19.5's installed file
  * group-infer: the omx-eq8 fixture matches the installed file, its version
    lines aside
  * debian: libomx-contract-dev floored at 3.16.0, as the spec floors
    omx-contract-devel
  * test: the spec and debian/control floor every build library the same (red)
  * renderer: a time_response's edges — one tap, 32 taps, the floor, a
    letter at the ceiling
  * renderer: a time_response draws its stems and its envelope on a time axis
  * The time_response display kind: a delay's taps and a reverb's decay
  * packaging: omx-dsp floors at 0.32.3, the release line's needs
  * renderer test: the soname check reads readelf in the C locale
  * renderer tests remove their scratch directories at exit
  * renderer-check counts the scratch its tests leave behind
  * The renderer builds against omx-dsp >= 0.32.2 < 0.33
  * The spectrum layer's provenance states what the reference is
  * describe: a declared panel's roles back its family and name a disagreeing
    meaning
  * describe: the panel a plugin serves is read as the declared form
  * test: describe given omx-comp's served panel over a scan's descriptor, red
  * renderer: the spectrum layer, on the console analyser's axes
  * renderer: the spectrum layer's tests, red first
  * Makefile: the shared checks' checkout is OPENMIXER_DOTGITHUB
  * Artifact retention: explicit retention-days, 30 on a tag and 2 otherwise
  * commit-msg: take the current stub from the checker's release line
  * ci: the package, lint and runtime-install cells follow the release set
    (D25)
  * test: no CI matrix names bookworm by hand (red)
  * release 0.13.8: plugin-hostd and plugin-hostd-contract >= 0.20.7 and
    below 0.21
  * release 0.13.8: the plugin-hostd floors are the version every quick cell
    serves
  * release 0.13.8: the omx-contract npm dependency floors at 3.18.0 too
  * release: 0.13.8, built against omx-contract 3.18.0 (D30)
  * ci: the staging channel out again: an ordinary run builds against the
    channel (D25)
  * ci: every omx package comes from the channel, refused from staging;
    staging added back to show it fire (red, D25)
  * Contract files keep the $schema the floor's reader reads
  * ci: an ordinary run builds against the channel, not the staging channel
  * The organisation's name: FreeMixer becomes Open-Mixer and OpenMixer
  * systemd: a sync drop-in's post step exits 0 when its opt-in unit is
    disabled (plugin-qualify#56)

